MID_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default: Activate
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC11_14: Activates device. (Activate all to\ndispel the magical barrier.)
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC12_08: Activates device. (Activate all to\ndispel the elephant rider's barrier.)
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC13_12: Activates device. (Activate several\nto dispel the magical barriers.)
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC14_06: Activates device to nullify the\neffect of pure water on all units.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC14_13: Activates device to magically\nreinforce barriers against\nEarthen Hurl for one turn.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC15_07: Activates device. (Activate all to\ndispel the giant's enhancement.)
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC15_15: Activates device to disarm\nfloor traps.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC18_14: Activates device to deal damage to\nfoes on nearby floor traps. (Can be\nused twice.)
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC13_13_2: Activates device. (Activate all to\nopen the portcullis.)
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC13_13_1: Activates device to turn on the\nwarp spots.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC16_18: Activates device to stop flamma\nproduction.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC18_10: Activates device to switch foes'\nenhancements between Prt\nand Rsl.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC18_03: Activates device to enhance\nAnatolia.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC12_03: Operates device. Interact with three\nto dispel Anatolia's enhancements.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC12_15: Tampers with and activates device.\nWill activate the enemy Titanus\nbut destroy all of its barriers.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SCXX_06: Activates device. Activate both\nin the same phase to operate\nthe onager.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC12_12: Activates device to place a trap\nfor one turn. Cetus will become\nparalyzed if caught in the trap.
MID_H_BtlMenu_Terrain_Default_SC13_09: Activates device to repel fog on the\nentire map for your side's phase.
